  "scope": "Full7 type factory templates, base C1/C2/D1/D2/D0 and all7 derived plus generic D1/D0 leaves, including full original ConditionList composition over shipped64 rows. Actual pointer/Record allocation and deallocation are declared platform leaves. No Compile/Eval body, Android compilation or live gameplay is inferred.",
  "source_policies": [
    "ConditionFields definition borrow is the sole +4 store; all records reuse ConditionList projections.",
    "Source allocation is12/tag0 for quest state types0..2 and8/tag0 for types3..6; native Record storage may be larger.",
    "Source C2 clears definition+4 and stores base dispatch; three quest comparators then store0/1/2+8.",
    "Quest-state derived D1/D0 publish Generic dispatch, not their previous derived dispatch or base dispatch; other derived destructors retain their class dispatch.",
    "Deleting destructors publish dispatch before reaching actual deallocation; failed free retains that reached source prefix.",
    "No extra quest/condition dataset, VM, properties or timer owner is introduced."
  ]
